## The cold-gas thrusters' thrust dispersion, transcribed from adcs-sim-core actuators.rs (Rcs::new): each couple's
## thrust factor 1 + sigma n (the part's thrust_scale dispersion), drawn from the run's dispersion stream.
## The developer's transcription (S7.7), unsigned.
module rcsthrust

## A couple's thrust factor: 1 + sigma times a normal draw from disp.
fn thrust_factor(sigma: real[1] in 0 .. 0.1, disp: inout stream) -> f: real[1]
    let z = normal(disp)
    f = 1.0 + sigma*z
end
